{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f7b05f92-a2da-852d-89ae-dca9651aff7e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T13:57:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Tony, honey, I hope I'm not catching you at lunch. I've got flour up to my elbows, I'm rolling out a pie crust and I've got you on speaker on the counter, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, I'm here. What's going on with the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:54:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I got a notice in the mail yesterday saying my water could be shut off. A shutoff warning. Now, I've lived here a long time and I have never gotten one of those. It's Nadia Singh, I'm at 464 Gidley Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Singh, let me pull that up. Gidley Street, four sixty-four. Give me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:55:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, dear. I'm not going anywhere, this dough has to rest anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:55:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I see it. There's a past due balance on the account and the notice went out last week. The notice itself should have a date on it. Do you have it handy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me wipe my hands. [pause] Okay, it says something about ten days, but then it's got all this small print. So how much time do I actually have? Because honestly it's a lot of nerve for them to send this over a bill that looks too high to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:55:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten days from the date on the notice, so you've got some time, but I'd not sit on it. If you pay the past due amount or set up something with us before that date, the shutoff doesn't go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And can the meter be tested? Because this last bill is way up and I'm one person in that house most days. Something's off with that meter, I'd bet on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:56:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can request a meter test. I can put that request in for you today. A crew checks the meter to see if it's reading accurately, and if it is, there may be a charge, so keep that in mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:56:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, put it in. I'd rather know. And one more thing, my daughter helps me with the bills now, she does the computer part. She's going to want to call you herself. Can she be put on the account, authorized or whatever you call it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:56:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can do that. I'll need you to authorize her, so it's best if you tell us her name, and she can come in or you can send something in writing. Until then, we can only talk to the account holder."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:56:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, of course. I'll have her write it up tonight. Honestly, Tony, all this over a water bill. Irritating, is what it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I've got the meter test request noted. Is the number on file still the best one to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:56:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0158."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:56:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, that matches. Someone will call you about the meter test appointment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:57:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you, dear. I've got to get this crust in the pan before it sticks to everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:57:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, enjoy the pie. Take care, Ms. Singh."
    }
  ],
